---
/**
 * ============================================================================
 * NOTIFICATION BANNER CONTAINER (`NotificationBanner.astro`)
 * ============================================================================
 * 
 * ROLE OF THIS COMPONENT:
 * Acts as the dedicated mounting point for all runtime alert notifications.
 * 
 * WHY IS THIS AN ISOLATED COMPONENT?
 * Instead of hardcoding alerts in different parts of the UI or using intrusive
 * popups (`alert()`), we centralize all messaging in one predictable spot at the
 * top of the workspace.
 * 
 * ACCESSIBILITY HIGHLIGHT (`aria-live="polite"`):
 * When JavaScript injects a new notification into `#notifications-area`,
 * assistive technologies (screen readers) automatically read out the alert message
 * politely (waiting until the user is done with their current action).
 * 
 * See `showNotification()` and `clearNotifications()` in `src/scripts/app.ts`.
 */
---

<div id="notifications-area" class="notifications-wrapper" aria-live="polite">
  <!-- Dynamic notification banners (success, warning, danger, info) are appended here -->
</div>
